The patients table stores information about patients, including their name, email, phone number, and appointment history.

| Column Name | Data Type | Description |
| --- | --- | --- |
| id | SERIAL | Unique identifier for the patient |
| name | VARCHAR(255) | Patient name |
| email | VARCHAR(255) | Patient email |
| phone_number | VARCHAR(20) | Patient phone number |
| appointment_history | JSONB | Appointment history |